{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天團五月天於今年7月結束「5525＋2回到那一天」巡演後進入2年休團期，誰知結他手石頭日前被爆出因長期高強度演出導致腰椎滑脫舊疾頻復發，加上妻小移居英國、難以兼顧家庭，曾向友人吐露離開五月天的念頭，引發外界高度關注。</p><p>雖然經理人公司相信音</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:24:58.748715+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:01:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:18:20.035850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T18:18:20.035850+00:00","content_hash":"020aa213053fd4df233bee6789d56e46a9845ff3c4fd00cef305b3c697ac3057","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}